roved\n+// by their pinning tests in the pinned set below.\n+type declaredRefusalArm struct {\n+\tfile       string\n+\tfunction   string\n+\tcode       string\n+\tdetail     string\n+\toccurrence int\n+\tentry      string\n+\tbound      string\n+\t// detailSet carries the funneled detail set for the single\n+\t// dynamic-detail row; it is empty for every literal row.\n+\tdetailSet []string\n+}\n"}}}
